7. LEGAL COMPLIANCE

hiwee complies with applicable laws and regulations relating to child safety, child sexual abuse and exploitation, and the reporting and handling of CSAM.

We cooperate with appropriate authorities when required by applicable law.

8. ENFORCEMENT

We may take immediate action against accounts, content, or activity that violates these Child Safety Standards.

Depending on the severity of the violation, enforcement may include content removal, account restriction, suspension, or permanent termination.

